<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PERSKOR, KAGISO DISCUSSING REORGANISATION.</title>
<headline>PERSKOR, KAGISO DISCUSSING REORGANISATION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher Perskorgroep Ltd said on Wednesday that talks were under way with black empowerment group Kagiso Trust Investments on reorganising the control structure of the concern.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
